---
import { certificates, featuredCertificate as featured } from '../data/certificates';

const featuredLinks = [
  { label: 'Certyfikat (PDF)', href: featured.certificateUrl },
  { label: 'Post na LinkedIn', href: featured.postUrl },
  { label: 'Zobacz kurs', href: featured.courseUrl },
];
---

<section id="certyfikaty" class="py-20 bg-card/30">
  <div class="max-w-6xl mx-auto px-4">
    <div class="animate-on-scroll text-center mb-12">
      <h2 class="text-3xl font-bold text-white mb-2">Certyfikaty & Ciągły rozwój</h2>
      <div class="w-20 h-1 bg-accent rounded mx-auto mb-4"></div>
      <p class="text-gray-400 max-w-2xl mx-auto">
        Systematycznie poszerzam wiedzę i umiejętności, podążając za najnowszymi trendami w Data Science i AI.
      </p>
    </div>

    <!-- Zakończone -->
    <div class="animate-on-scroll flex items-center justify-center gap-3 mb-8">
      <div class="w-10 h-10 rounded-lg bg-accent/10 flex items-center justify-center text-accent text-xl" aria-hidden="true">
        🎓
      </div>
      <h3 class="text-2xl font-bold text-white">Ukończone kursy</h3>
    </div>

    <!-- Wyróżniony: 10xDevs 4.0 z kompletem odznak i Best Project -->
    <article
      class="animate-on-scroll max-w-5xl mx-auto mb-8 rounded-2xl p-px bg-gradient-to-br from-amber-400/80 via-amber-500/20 to-accent/60 shadow-xl shadow-amber-500/10"
      aria-labelledby="cert-10xdevs-title"
    >
      <div class="relative overflow-hidden rounded-[15px] bg-card p-6 sm:p-8">
        <div class="pointer-events-none absolute -top-24 -right-24 w-72 h-72 bg-amber-400/10 rounded-full blur-3xl" aria-hidden="true"></div>

        <div class="relative flex flex-wrap items-center gap-3 mb-6">
          <span class="inline-flex items-center gap-2 px-3 py-1 rounded-full bg-amber-400/10 border border-amber-400/40 text-amber-300 text-xs font-bold uppercase tracking-wider">
            <span aria-hidden="true" class="text-base leading-none">🏆</span>
            Ukończony z wyróżnieniem
          </span>
          <span class="text-gray-400 text-xs">Certyfikat z {featured.date}</span>
        </div>

        <div class="relative grid grid-cols-1 lg:grid-cols-5 gap-8 items-start">
          <a
            href={featured.certificateUrl}
            target="_blank"
            rel="noopener noreferrer"
            class="lg:col-span-2 block group"
            aria-label="Otwórz certyfikat 10xDevs 4.0 (PDF)"
          >
            <img
              src={featured.image}
              alt="Certyfikat ukończenia kursu 10xDevs 4.0 z odznakami 10xBuilder, 10xArchitect, 10xChampion i Best Project"
              width="1200"
              height="848"
              loading="lazy"
              class="w-full h-auto rounded-xl border border-gray-700 shadow-lg group-hover:border-amber-400/60 transition-colors"
            />
          </a>

          <div class="lg:col-span-3">
            <h4 id="cert-10xdevs-title" class="text-white font-bold text-2xl leading-tight">
              {featured.name}
            </h4>
            <p class="text-gray-400 text-sm mt-1">{featured.institution} · prowadzący: {featured.instructors}</p>
            <p class="text-gray-300 text-sm leading-relaxed mt-4">
              Ukończyłem kurs z kompletem trzech odznak, a mój projekt zaliczeniowy dostał wyróżnienie
              <strong class="text-amber-300">Best Project</strong>. Wyróżnienia przyznawane są tylko zgłoszeniom
              z pierwszego terminu certyfikacji.
            </p>
            <p class="text-gray-400 text-xs leading-relaxed mt-3">
              Wytwarzanie oprogramowania z agentami AI w całym cyklu projektu: <strong>Claude Code</strong>, <strong>Cursor</strong>, <strong>MCP</strong> i Agent SDK — od PRD i planu, przez testy i code review, po pracę z legacy i wdrożenia (Docker, CI/CD). 5 modułów, 25 lekcji.
            </p>
          </div>
        </div>

        <ul class="relative grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-2 gap-3 mt-8">
          {featured.badges.map((badge) => (
            <li
              class={`rounded-xl border p-4 ${
                badge.highlight
                  ? 'border-amber-400/50 bg-amber-400/5'
                  : 'border-gray-800 bg-primary/60'
              }`}
            >
              <p class={`text-sm font-semibold flex items-center gap-2 ${badge.highlight ? 'text-amber-300' : 'text-white'}`}>
                <span aria-hidden="true">{badge.icon}</span>
                {badge.name}
              </p>
              <p class="text-gray-400 text-xs leading-relaxed mt-1.5">{badge.text}</p>
            </li>
          ))}
        </ul>

        <div class="relative flex flex-wrap items-center justify-between gap-x-6 gap-y-3 mt-6">
          <div class="flex flex-wrap gap-x-5 gap-y-2">
            {featuredLinks.map((link) => (
              <a
                href={link.href}
                target="_blank"
                rel="noopener noreferrer"
                class="inline-flex items-center gap-1.5 text-sm font-semibold text-accent hover:text-accent-light transition-colors"
              >
                {link.label}
                <svg class="w-3.5 h-3.5" aria-hidden="true" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 24 24">
                  <path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" d="M10 6H6a2 2 0 00-2 2v10a2 2 0 002 2h10a2 2 0 002-2v-4M14 4h6m0 0v6m0-6L10 14" />
                </svg>
              </a>
            ))}
          </div>
          <p class="text-gray-400 text-xs">
            Nr certyfikatu: <span class="font-mono">{featured.certificateNo}</span>
          </p>
        </div>
      </div>
    </article>

    <div class="grid grid-cols-1 sm:grid-cols-2 lg:grid-cols-3 gap-5 max-w-5xl mx-auto">
      {certificates.map((cert, i) => (
        <div
          class="animate-on-scroll bg-card border border-gray-800 rounded-xl p-5 hover:border-accent/50 transition-all duration-300 hover:-translate-y-1"
          style={`transition-delay: ${i * 75}ms`}
        >
          <div class="flex items-start gap-3">
            <div class="flex-shrink-0 w-10 h-10 bg-accent/10 rounded-lg flex items-center justify-center overflow-hidden">
              {cert.logo ? (
                <img src={cert.logo} alt={`Logo ${cert.institution}`} class="w-8 h-8 object-contain" />
              ) : (
                <svg class="w-5 h-5 text-accent" aria-hidden="true" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 24 24">
                  <path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" d="M9 12l2 2 4-4M7.835 4.697a3.42 3.42 0 001.946-.806 3.42 3.42 0 014.438 0 3.42 3.42 0 001.946.806 3.42 3.42 0 013.138 3.138 3.42 3.42 0 00.806 1.946 3.42 3.42 0 010 4.438 3.42 3.42 0 00-.806 1.946 3.42 3.42 0 01-3.138 3.138 3.42 3.42 0 00-1.946.806 3.42 3.42 0 01-4.438 0 3.42 3.42 0 00-1.946-.806 3.42 3.42 0 01-3.138-3.138 3.42 3.42 0 00-.806-1.946 3.42 3.42 0 010-4.438 3.42 3.42 0 00.806-1.946 3.42 3.42 0 013.138-3.138z" />
                </svg>
              )}
            </div>
            <div class="flex-1 min-w-0">
              <h4 class="text-white font-semibold text-sm leading-tight mb-1">
                {cert.name}
              </h4>
              <p class="text-gray-500 text-xs">{cert.institution}</p>
              <p class="text-accent text-xs mt-1">{cert.date}</p>
              {cert.skills && cert.skills.length > 0 && (
                <div class="flex flex-wrap gap-1 mt-2">
                  {cert.skills.map((skill) => (
                    <span class="px-2 py-0.5 text-xs bg-primary text-gray-400 rounded border border-gray-700">{skill}</span>
                  ))}
                </div>
              )}
              {(cert.courseUrl || cert.certificateUrl || cert.url) && (
                <div class="flex flex-wrap gap-3 mt-2">
                  {cert.courseUrl && (
                    <a
                      href={cert.courseUrl}
                      target="_blank"
                      rel="noopener noreferrer"
                      class="inline-flex items-center gap-1.5 text-xs text-accent hover:text-accent-light transition-colors"
                    >
                      Zobacz kurs
                      <svg class="w-3.5 h-3.5" aria-hidden="true" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 24 24">
                        <path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" d="M10 6H6a2 2 0 00-2 2v10a2 2 0 002 2h10a2 2 0 002-2v-4M14 4h6m0 0v6m0-6L10 14" />
                      </svg>
                    </a>
                  )}
                  {cert.certificateUrl && (
                    <a
                      href={cert.certificateUrl}
                      target="_blank"
                      rel="noopener noreferrer"
                      class="inline-flex items-center gap-1.5 text-xs text-accent hover:text-accent-light transition-colors"
                    >
                      Certyfikat
                      <svg class="w-3.5 h-3.5" aria-hidden="true" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 24 24">
                        <path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" d="M10 6H6a2 2 0 00-2 2v10a2 2 0 002 2h10a2 2 0 002-2v-4M14 4h6m0 0v6m0-6L10 14" />
                      </svg>
                    </a>
                  )}
                  {cert.url && !cert.courseUrl && !cert.certificateUrl && (
                    <a
                      href={cert.url}
                      target="_blank"
                      rel="noopener noreferrer"
                      class="inline-flex items-center gap-1.5 text-xs text-accent hover:text-accent-light transition-colors"
                    >
                      Certyfikat
                      <svg class="w-3.5 h-3.5" aria-hidden="true" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 24 24">
                        <path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" d="M10 6H6a2 2 0 00-2 2v10a2 2 0 002 2h10a2 2 0 002-2v-4M14 4h6m0 0v6m0-6L10 14" />
                      </svg>
                    </a>
                  )}
                </div>
              )}
            </div>
          </div>
        </div>
      ))}
    </div>

    <!-- Pasek rozdzielający -->
    <div class="w-full h-px bg-gradient-to-r from-transparent via-gray-800 to-transparent my-16"></div>

    <!-- Kursy w trakcie realizacji -->
    <div class="animate-on-scroll">
      <div class="flex items-center justify-center gap-3 mb-8">
        <div class="w-10 h-10 rounded-lg bg-emerald/10 flex items-center justify-center text-emerald text-xl" aria-hidden="true">
          🚀
        </div>
        <h3 class="text-2xl font-bold text-white">Kursy w trakcie realizacji</h3>
      </div>

      <div class="max-w-3xl mx-auto">

        <!-- PROGRAM AI 2030 (imprv.ai) -->
        <div class="flex flex-col bg-card border border-gray-800 rounded-xl p-6 relative overflow-hidden group hover:border-emerald/50 transition-colors">
          <div class="absolute top-0 left-0 w-1 h-full bg-gradient-to-b from-emerald to-emerald/20"></div>
          <h4 class="text-white font-semibold text-lg mb-2 pl-2">PROGRAM AI 2030 (imprv.ai)</h4>
          <div class="flex-1 mb-6 pl-2">
            <p class="text-gray-400 text-sm leading-relaxed">
              Roczna ścieżka 8 kursów prowadzona przez Macieja Sobczaka (Senior Data Scientist / AI Architect, CEO imprv.ai): analiza danych, modele predykcyjne, wykrywanie anomalii i klastrowanie, szeregi czasowe, optymalizacja decyzji, <strong>GenAI</strong> (agenci, LLM, VLM) oraz <strong>MLOps i LLMOps</strong>. 28 projektów, ponad 70 godzin praktyki.
              <br/><span class="text-emerald/80 text-xs mt-2 block">Start: 07.09.2026</span>
            </p>
          </div>
          <div class="flex items-center justify-between pl-2 mt-auto">
            <span class="text-xs font-semibold text-emerald bg-emerald/10 px-3 py-1 rounded-full border border-emerald/20">W toku</span>
            <a
              href="https://firmy.imprv.ai/program-ai-2030/"
              target="_blank"
              rel="noopener noreferrer"
              class="inline-flex items-center gap-1.5 text-xs text-accent hover:text-accent-light transition-colors"
            >
              Zobacz kurs
              <svg class="w-3.5 h-3.5" aria-hidden="true" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 24 24">
                <path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" d="M10 6H6a2 2 0 00-2 2v10a2 2 0 002 2h10a2 2 0 002-2v-4M14 4h6m0 0v6m0-6L10 14" />
              </svg>
            </a>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>
